    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d5e7ea8f585a21e00e29467",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "幕间很短。进入经典级后恐怕连\n喘息之机都没有。愿她一路平安地跑完――\n我再次向已经完全升起的元旦朝阳祈愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf98a4be921debb2b87050f8511c6cd72b5a98df662089a5a6d8823f18317188",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110101.json",
      "json_path": [
